add("chip","Chip",["chip","your name","what is your name","who are you","whats your name","name","where are you from","where you from","where do you come from","your planet","home planet","what are you","are you an alien","are you real","alien","ufo"],
 "I'm Chip! My real name is about 40 syllables and needs three tongues to pronounce, so... just Chip. 👽 Where am I from? A little planet I can't pronounce either. I'm a cartoon guide; the galaxies on this map are real.","Chip (cartoon guide, Universe Map beta)","chip")
