add("asteroidbelt","Asteroid belt",["asteroid belt","asteroids","asteroid"],"The main asteroid belt lies between Mars and Jupiter. Despite the movies, it's mostly empty space: all of it together has only about 3% of the Moon's mass, and Ceres holds about a quarter of that.","NASA Science: Asteroids","solar","body:Ceres")
