add("solarsystem","The Solar System",["solar system","our solar system","planets","how many planets"],"The Solar System has the Sun, 8 planets, at least 5 dwarf planets, hundreds of moons, and millions of asteroids and comets. It formed about 4.6 billion years ago. (On this map the planets are drawn bigger than real so you can see them.)","NASA Science: Solar System; IAU","solar","body:Sun")
add("voyager","Voyager 1",["voyager","voyager 1","farthest spacecraft"],"Voyager 1 (launched 1977) is the farthest human-made object, now well over 160 AU from the Sun. It crossed into interstellar space in 2012. Its light-speed signals take over 22 hours to reach us.","NASA JPL Voyager mission status","solar")
